{"ID":"20240205153917-xfutkuh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153917-xfutkuh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153917-xfutkuh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083436-tigps7i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607123325-9ub3agb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3441,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619113941-rtssg8e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"060防风","type":"doc","updated":"20240913160120"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206083436-tigps7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083436-tigps7i","updated":"20240206083439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产内蒙古东部地区。\n【性状】\t干燥的根呈圆锥形或纺锤形，稍弯曲，长2030cm，根头部直径约1cm，中部直径11.5cm。表面灰黄色或灰棕色。根头部有密集的细环节，节上有棕色粗毛，顶端有茎的残痕；根部外皮皱缩而粗糙，有不整齐的纵皱及细横纹，除散生污黄色的横长皮孔外，点状突起的须根痕也随处可见。质松而软，易折断，断而不平坦，木部淡黄色，皮部黄棕色有裂隙，射线呈放射状。气微香，味微甘。\n【性味】\t辛、甘，微温。\n【功效】\t祛风解表，胜湿止痛，止痉。用于治疗外感风寒，头痛，目眩，项强、风寒湿痹，骨节酸痛，四肢挛急，破伤风。\n【注解】\t“扫帚头”：指防风根头顶部的棕色或棕褐色毛状残存叶基，形如扫帚。\n“蚯蚓头”：指药材根头部的明显密集的环纹，也称为“旗杆顶”。\n“菊花心”：指药材横断面的纹理，形状如同开放的菊花。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083430-u7kp40o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083430-u7kp40o","updated":"20240206083430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083430-dkwwlsm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205154945-9i93yuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205154945-9i93yuk","updated":"20240205154952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"防风"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/防风-20240205154945-mufc77j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"防风2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/防风2-20240205154952-n143k20.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240619113539-9p5yng6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619113539-9p5yng6","updated":"20240807091620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 313px;","style":"width: 303px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"防风"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/防风-20240619113539-4qrxh4k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 303px;\" parent-style=\"width: 313px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 331px;","style":"width: 321px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"防风3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/防风3-20240619114024-dakmcw9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 321px;\" parent-style=\"width: 331px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"防风6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/防风6-20240619114605-sasjfi8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\